/Title (CRISP\055DM\040Twenty\040Years\040Later\072\040From\040Data\040Mining\040Processes\040to\040Data\040Science\040Trajectories)
/Author (Fernando\040Martínez\055Plumed\054\040Lidia\040Contreras\055Ochando\054\040Cèsar\040Ferri\054\040José\040Hernández\055Orallo\054\040Meelis\040Kull\054\040Nicolas\040Lachiche\054\040María\040José\040Ramírez\055Quintana\054\040Peter\040A\056\040Flach)
/Subject (CRISP\055DM\050CRoss\055Industry\040Standard\040Process\040for\040Data\040Mining\051\040has\040its\040origins\040in\040the\040second\040half\040of\040the\040nineties\040and\040is\040thus\040about\040two\040decades\040old\056\040According\040to\040many\040surveys\040and\040user\040polls\040it\040is\040still\040the\040de\040facto\040standard\040for\040developing\040data\040mining\040and\040knowledge\040discovery\040projects\056\040However\054\040undoubtedly\040the\040field\040has\040moved\040on\040considerably\040in\040twenty\040years\054\040with\040data\040science\040now\040the\040leading\040term\040being\040favoured\040over\040data\040mining\040\056\040In\040this\040paper\040we\040investigate\040whether\054\040and\040in\040what\040contexts\054\040CRISP\055DM\040is\040still\040fit\040for\040purpose\040for\040data\040science\040projects\056\040We\040argue\040that\040if\040the\040project\040is\040goal\055directed\040and\040process\055driven\040the\040process\040model\040view\040still\040largely\040holds\056\040On\040the\040other\040hand\054\040when\040data\040science\040projects\040become\040more\040exploratory\040the\040paths\040that\040the\040project\040can\040take\040become\040more\040varied\054\040and\040a\040more\040flexible\040model\040is\040called\040for\056\040We\040suggest\040what\040the\040outlines\040of\040such\040a\040trajectory\055based\040model\040might\040look\040like\040and\040how\040it\040can\040be\040used\040to\040categorise\040data\040science\040projects\040\050goal\055directed\054\040exploratory\040or\040data\040management\051\056\040We\040examine\040seven\040real\055life\040exemplars\040where\040exploratory\040activities\040play\040an\040important\040role\040and\040compare\040them\040against\04051\040use\040cases\040extracted\040from\040the\040NIST\040Big\040Data\040Public\040Working\040Group\056\040We\040anticipate\040this\040categorisation\040can\040help\040project\040planning\040in\040terms\040of\040time\040and\040cost\040characteristics\056)
